  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.04,
      "text": " I started with a phone and a lot of questions."
    },
    {
      "start": 3.14,
      "end": 5.72,
      "text": " Could I build my own AI operating system without coding?"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.16,
      "end": 11.56,
      "text": " First, I learned the parts, a model to think, tools to act, skills to guide it, and saved"
    },
    {
      "start": 11.56,
      "end": 12.08,
      "text": " context."
    },
    {
      "start": 12.56,
      "end": 13.48,
      "text": " Then I built a router."
    },
    {
      "start": 14.6,
      "end": 16.56,
      "text": " New information goes to the right specialist."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.52,
      "end": 19.58,
      "text": " I call these specialists my elders."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.08,
      "end": 21.24,
      "text": " The router points the way."
    },
    {
      "start": 22.28,
      "end": 26.36,
      "text": " It loads the useful context instead of dumping every note into every answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 26.76,
      "end": 27.58,
      "text": " I stay the chief."
    },
    {
      "start": 27.58,
      "end": 34.58,
      "text": " small reversible jobs can move ahead real choices come to my desk where I"
    },
    {
      "start": 34.58,
      "end": 40.02,
      "text": " decide the quartermaster helps pick the tools the architect helps organize the"
    },
    {
      "start": 40.02,
      "end": 45.06,
      "text": " system their work becomes something I can use but a confident answer isn't"
    },
    {
      "start": 45.06,
      "end": 50.24,
      "text": " proof we plant faults and check the result I'm still proving the"
    },
    {
      "start": 50.24,
      "end": 54.62,
      "text": " foundation's work next help a friend build their own system and document"
    },
    {
      "start": 55.5,
      "end": 57.36,
      "text": " One useful step at a time."
    }
  ],
